    "description": "- Spearheaded the construction of the automation testing architecture for 4 Android projects in Kotlin.\n- Exhibited skills in implementing 100+ automated tests for numerous features and increasing test coverage by 153% of various Android applications in Java and Kotlin.\n- Improved testing platform stability by 45%, reducing system downtime and accelerating deployment of updates.\n- Instrumental in creating and maintaining Shell scripts to set up Jenkins runs and emulators for automated UI test suites, saving 3+ hours of manual effort per week.\n- Administered an API in Python for snapshot testing along with a changelog of uploaded snapshots.\n- Established 4 Jenkins jobs and scheduled automated runs, optimizing CI/CD workflows and reducing build times by 32%.\n- Key role in evaluating test failures in regression, sanity, and smoke runs from Cucumber reports.\n- Developed regex to categorize failures. Created tasks and bug tickets along with Charles and Logcat logs for identified failures in Jira.\n- Oversaw build release cuts for approval. Mentored teammate on overseeing the build release process.\n- Coordinated creation and edits of Cucumber scenarios and feature files.\n- Contributed to the Android client codebase for various features and projects in Java and Kotlin.\n- Collaborated across the Android, iOS, Web, backend, and design teams on the planning and design of 20+ new features and 2 projects.\n- Successfully mentored teammate on native test development for these 2 projects and applications I led",
